<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio - Asya  GNU nano 9.1                                 index.html               >
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nama Kamu - Portfolio Eksklusif</title>
    
    <!-- Fonts & Icons -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #D4AF37;
            --gold-light: #F3E5AB;
            --dark-bg: #0f0f0f;
            --dark-card: #1a1a1a;
            --text-main: #f0f0f0;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            --transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
            cursor: none; /* Hide default cursor for custom one */
        }

        ::selection {
            background-color: var(--gold);
            color: var(--dark-bg);
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        button, input, textarea {
            font-family: inherit;
            border: none;
            outline: none;
            background: none;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .text-center { text-align: center; }
        .text-gold { color: var(--gold); }
        .text-white { color: #ffffff; }
        .text-muted { color: var(--text-muted); }
        
        .font-serif { font-family: var(--font-serif); }
        .font-light { font-weight: 300; }
        .font-bold { font-weight: 700; }
        
        .tracking-widest { letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
        .tracking-extreme { letter-spacing: 0.3em; }
        .uppercase { text-transform: uppercase; }
        .italic { font-style: italic; }

        .d-flex { display: flex; }
        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }
        .align-center { align-items: center; }
        .justify-center { justify-content: center; }
        .justify-between { justify-content: space-between; }
        .justify-end { justify-content: flex-end; }
        
        .grid { display: grid; }
        .gap-4 { gap: 1rem; }
        .gap-8 { gap: 2rem; }
        .gap-12 { gap: 3rem; }

        .w-full { width: 100%; }
        .h-full { height: 100%; }
        .relative { position: relative; }
        .absolute { position: absolute; }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .container { padding: 0 3rem; }
            .section { padding: 8rem 0; }
            .md-flex-row { flex-direction: row; }
            .md-grid-cols-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .md-grid-cols-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
            .md-grid-cols-5 { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); }
            .hidden-md { display: none !important; }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 767px) {
            .hidden-mobile { display: none !important; }
        }

        /* Glassmorphism */
        .glass {
            background: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
        }

        /* Hover Effects */
        .hover-gold { transition: var(--transition); }
        .hover-gold:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        /* Custom Cursor */
        .cursor-dot, .cursor-outline {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 9999;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .cursor-dot {
            width: 8px; height: 8px;
            background-color: var(--gold);
        }
        .cursor-outline {
            width: 40px; height: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.5);
            transition: transform 0.1s ease-out, background-color 0.2s;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .cursor-dot, .cursor-outline { display: none; }
            body { cursor: auto; }
        }

        /* Scroll Animations */
        .fade-in-up {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s ease-out;
        }
        .fade-in-up.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* Section Divider */
        .section-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3), transparent);
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 80%;
        }

        /* Buttons */
        .btn-outline {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            color: var(--gold);
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            background-color: var(--gold);
            color: var(--dark-bg);
        }

        /* Loader */
        #loader {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            z-index: 10000;
            display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
        }
        .loader-line {
            width: 100px; height: 2px;
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .loader-line::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; left: -50%; width: 50%; height: 100%;
            background: var(--gold);
            animation: loading 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes loading {
            0% { left: -50%; }
            100% { left: 100%; }
        }

        .navbar {
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 50;
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .navbar.scrolled {
            padding: 0.75rem 0;
            background: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.95);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .nav-logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--gold);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .nav-logo:hover { color: white; }
        
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
        .nav-links a {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: white; }
        
        .mobile-menu-btn {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .mobile-menu {
            position: absolute;
            top: 100%; left: 0; width: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.98);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
            padding: 2rem 0;
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        .mobile-menu.active { display: flex; }
        .mobile-menu a { color: white; font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }

        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-top: 5rem;
        }
        .hero-subtitle { font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .hero-title { font-size: 4.5rem; }
        }
        @media (min-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-title { font-size: 5.5rem; }
        }
        .hero-desc {
            max-width: 42rem;
            margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
        }
        .social-icons {
            display: flex; gap: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .social-icons a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .social-icons a:hover {
            color: var(--gold);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }
        
        .scroll-indicator {
            position: absolute; bottom: 2.5rem; left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }
        .scroll-text { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #6b7280; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .scroll-line { width: 1px; height: 3rem; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--gold), transparent); }
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, 0); }
            50% { transform: translate(-50%, -10px); }
        }

        .about-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; }
        .about-img-wrapper { width: 100%; position: relative; }
        .about-img-bg {
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: var(--gold);
            transform: translate(1rem, 1rem);
            z-index: -1;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        .about-img-wrapper:hover .about-img-bg { transform: translate(1.5rem, 1.5rem); }
        .about-img {
            width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
            transition: filter 0.7s ease;
        }
        .about-img-wrapper:hover .about-img { filter: grayscale(0%); }
        .about-content { width: 100%; }
        
        .section-title { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.2; }
        .section-subtitle { font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 2rem; display: block; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .about-grid { flex-direction: row; }
            .about-img-wrapper, .about-content { width: 50%; }
            .section-title { font-size: 3rem; }
        }
        
        .about-text p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
        .stat-number { font-size: 2.25rem; color: white; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #6b7280; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }

        .skills-section { background-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); }
        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2.5rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
        
        .skill-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
        .skill-icon-box {
            width: 5rem; height: 5rem;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .skill-icon-bg {
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
            transform: scale(0);
            border-radius: 50%;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .skill-icon-box i { font-size: 1.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); position: relative; z-index: 10; transition: var(--transition); }
        
        .skill-item:hover .skill-icon-box { border-color: var(--gold); }
        .skill-item:hover .skill-icon-bg { transform: scale(1); }
        .skill-item:hover .skill-icon-box i { color: var(--gold); }
        .skill-title { font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: white; }

        .projects-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
        .view-all-link { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; transition: var(--transition); }
        .view-all-link:hover { color: white; }
        
        .projects-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .projects-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .project-card.offset { margin-top: 6rem; }
        }

        .project-card {
            background: var(--dark-card);
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
        }
        .project-card:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }
        .project-img-container { aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden; }
        .project-img {
            width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.8;
            transition: all 0.7s ease;
        }
        .project-card:hover .project-img { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.1); }
        
        .project-overlay {
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 50%, transparent 100%);
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .project-info {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;
            padding: 2rem;
            transform: translateY(1rem);
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        .project-card:hover .project-info { transform: translateY(0); }
        .project-category { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .project-title { font-size: 1.875rem; color: white; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .project-line { height: 1px; width: 0; background: var(--gold); transition: width 0.7s ease; }
        .project-card:hover .project-line { width: 100%; }

        .mobile-view-all { margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center; }

        .contact-section { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .contact-bg-decor {
            position: absolute; top: 0; right: -5rem;
            font-size: 20rem; font-family: var(--font-serif);
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            pointer-events: none; user-select: none;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .contact-container { max-width: 56rem; margin: 0 auto; }
        .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 3fr; }
        }
        
        .contact-info-block { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .contact-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .contact-email { font-size: 1.125rem; color: white; transition: var(--transition); font-family: var(--font-serif); }
        .contact-email:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        .contact-text { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 300; }
        
        .contact-social { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
        .contact-social a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.25rem; transition: var(--transition); }
        .contact-social a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        .form-group { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 300;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
        }
        .form-input::placeholder { color: #4b5563; }
        textarea.form-input { resize: none; }
        
        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-submit span { position: relative; z-index: 10; }
        .btn-submit-bg {
            position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--gold);
            transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover { color: var(--dark-bg); }
        .btn-submit:hover .btn-submit-bg { transform: scaleX(1); }

        .footer {
            padding: 2rem 0;
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-weight: 300;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="loader">
        <div class="loader-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="cursor-dot hidden-mobile"></div>
    <div class="cursor-outline hidden-mobile"></div>

    <nav class="navbar glass" id="navbar">
        <div class="container d-flex justify-between align-center">
            <a href="#" class="font-serif nav-logo">NK.</a>
            
            <!-- Desktop Menu -->
            <ul class="nav-links hidden-mobile">
                <li><a href="#home" class="hover-gold">Beranda</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about" class="hover-gold">Tentang</a></li>
                <li><a href="#skills" class="hover-gold">Keahlian</a></li>
                <li><a href="#projects" class="hover-gold">Proyek</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact" class="hover-gold">Kontak</a></li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->
            <button class="mobile-menu-btn hidden-md" id="mobile-menu-btn">
                <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Mobile Menu -->
        <div class="mobile-menu hidden-md" id="mobile-menu">
            <a href="#home" class="mobile-link hover-gold">Beranda</a>
            <a href="#about" class="mobile-link hover-gold">Tentang</a>
            <a href="#skills" class="mobile-link hover-gold">Keahlian</a>
            <a href="#projects" class="mobile-link hover-gold">Proyek</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="mobile-link hover-gold">Kontak</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section id="home" class="hero relative">
        <div class="container text-center relative fade-in-up">
            <p class="text-gold tracking-extreme uppercase hero-subtitle">Portofolio Profesional</p>
            <h1 class="font-serif font-bold hero-title">
                <span class="text-white" style="display: block;">Halo, Saya</span>
                <span class="text-gold">Nama Kamu</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-muted font-light hero-desc">
                Menciptakan pengalaman digital yang elegan, memadukan estetika mewah dengan fungsionalitas modern.
            </p>
            
            <div class="d-flex flex-col align-center">
                <!-- Ikon Sosial Media -->
                <div class="social-icons">
                    <a href="mailto:halo@namakamu.com" aria-label="Email"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" aria-label="GitHub"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                </div>

                <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline">Mulai Diskusi</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Scroll indicator -->
        <div class="scroll-indicator">
            <span class="scroll-text">Gulir ke Bawah</span>
            <div class="scroll-line"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <section id="about" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-grid">
                <!-- Image -->
                <div class="about-img-wrapper fade-in-up">
                    <div class="about-img-bg"></div>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Potret Profil" class="about-img">
                </div>
                
                <!-- Content -->
                <div class="about-content fade-in-up">
                    <h2 class="font-serif text-white section-title">Sebuah <span class="text-gold italic">Simfoni</span> Digital</h2>
                    <span class="section-subtitle">Filosofi Desain & Pengembangan</span>
                    
                    <div class="about-text font-light">
                        <p>Dalam setiap baris kode dan setiap piksel yang dirancang, saya mencari harmoni. Fokus saya adalah menciptakan identitas visual yang tidak hanya indah secara estetika, tetapi juga kuat secara fungsional.</p>
                        <p>Dengan pengalaman lebih dari X tahun di industri kreatif digital, saya telah berkolaborasi dengan berbagai merek premium untuk mewujudkan visi mereka ke dalam kanvas digital yang interaktif dan berkesan.</p>
                        <p>Saya percaya bahwa kemewahan sejati dalam dunia digital terletak pada kesederhanaan, kecepatan, dan perhatian pada detail yang terkecil.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="stats-grid">
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-serif stat-number">5+</p>
                            <p class="stat-label">Tahun Pengalaman</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-serif stat-number">50+</p>
                            <p class="stat-label">Proyek Selesai</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <section id="skills" class="section skills-section">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <h2 class="font-serif text-white section-title fade-in-up" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Keahlian <span class="text-gold italic">Utama</span></h2>
            <p class="text-muted font-light fade-in-up" style="max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto;">Kombinasi antara seni desain dan logika pemrograman untuk menghasilkan karya yang sempurna.</p>

            <div class="skills-grid fade-in-up">
